WEBVTT

00:18.600 --> 00:19.960
My son.

00:21.399 --> 00:24.719
My son, my dear son.

00:26.839 --> 00:28.679
You've left me behind like this.

00:31.199 --> 00:33.640
You've abandoned me and gone.

00:35.039 --> 00:36.039
Heavens.

00:36.920 --> 00:38.520
How could this be so unjust?

00:39.679 --> 00:42.000
How could this be so unjust?

00:42.439 --> 00:43.240
Mother.

00:45.760 --> 00:47.110
Please don't grieve too deeply.

00:48.200 --> 00:49.920
Brother died heroically for our nation.

00:49.930 --> 00:51.550
He gave his life
in service to the realm.

00:51.560 --> 00:52.920
His sacrifice was an honor.

00:54.399 --> 00:55.560
It was me...

00:57.520 --> 00:58.280
I...

00:59.640 --> 01:02.320
who failed to keep my brother safe.

01:05.560 --> 01:06.439
I...

01:08.920 --> 01:10.680
am guilty.

01:26.280 --> 01:27.239
Mother.

01:31.000 --> 01:33.760
Though I was not born of you,

01:34.480 --> 01:35.959
you raised me with boundless care.

01:36.640 --> 01:38.040
Your kindness gave me a second life.

01:38.840 --> 01:39.640
Now,

01:40.359 --> 01:42.000
with my brother taken from us,

01:42.560 --> 01:43.319
I will

01:45.239 --> 01:47.359
carry on his legacy.

01:48.840 --> 01:50.879
I will protect this realm.

01:51.719 --> 01:53.200
And I will care for you, Mother.

01:53.719 --> 01:55.200
I will never let you

01:55.959 --> 01:57.879
suffer another grievance.

02:18.159 --> 02:20.479
I watched you grow up.

02:21.240 --> 02:22.879
I know

02:25.039 --> 02:26.439
your character well.

02:27.199 --> 02:29.280
Your brother had great hopes for you.

02:30.224 --> 02:32.624
He always said you excelled
in both letters and arms.

02:33.159 --> 02:36.000
That one day, you would
become a pillar of the nation.

02:36.639 --> 02:37.479
Now,

02:37.719 --> 02:39.240
only you

02:39.240 --> 02:41.919
can finish what he left undone.

02:42.000 --> 02:45.560
I will never fail the trust
you've placed in me, Mother.

02:47.639 --> 02:49.080
Nor will I fail

02:50.000 --> 02:51.560
my brother's spirit in heaven.

03:06.120 --> 03:06.960
Mother.

03:09.479 --> 03:10.919
There is one more matter

03:13.960 --> 03:15.360
I must report to you.

03:15.599 --> 03:16.520
What is it?

03:17.520 --> 03:18.240
Guards.

03:34.800 --> 03:35.560
Mother.

03:36.159 --> 03:37.000
This child

03:37.759 --> 03:39.159
was born to my consort.

03:39.376 --> 03:41.360
She endured countless hardships
amid the war

03:41.376 --> 03:43.104
in the northwest
and narrowly escaped death

03:43.280 --> 03:44.599
to bring him into this world.

03:45.240 --> 03:46.039
This child

03:46.360 --> 03:48.639
was born amid relentless gunfire.

03:48.879 --> 03:49.879
I believe

03:50.360 --> 03:51.919
he is destined for greatness.

03:52.199 --> 03:54.240
After I ascend the throne,

03:55.439 --> 03:56.759
I intend to name him

03:59.039 --> 04:00.080
Crown Prince.

04:03.280 --> 04:04.479
What did you say?

04:06.800 --> 04:08.319
You want to make him Crown Prince?

04:09.759 --> 04:10.840
Don't you think

04:12.000 --> 04:13.719
you're rushing things a bit?

04:16.360 --> 04:17.199
I...

04:19.079 --> 04:20.920
have made up my mind.

04:27.399 --> 04:28.680
He will be

04:30.040 --> 04:31.720
the child I cherish most.

05:51.480 --> 05:52.240
=Blossoms of Power=

05:52.250 --> 05:55.060
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

05:55.060 --> 05:57.860
=Episode 36=

06:01.040 --> 06:02.160
How could this happen?

06:03.759 --> 06:05.199
You're a dying man.

06:06.319 --> 06:07.759
Are you still trying to deceive me?

06:08.120 --> 06:09.680
I never lied to you.

06:10.279 --> 06:12.519
It's precisely because I'm dying

06:12.759 --> 06:13.639
that I have to

06:14.680 --> 06:16.560
tell you

06:16.639 --> 06:18.560
the whole truth.

06:19.040 --> 06:20.000
Why?

06:20.959 --> 06:23.319
Why did you claim back then

06:23.319 --> 06:25.160
that this child
was your own flesh and blood?

06:25.839 --> 06:26.839
Because

06:27.519 --> 06:29.279
I knew better than anyone

06:29.839 --> 06:32.279
that if I brought this child
back to the imperial capital,

06:33.079 --> 06:34.639
you, as the Grand Empress Dowager,

06:34.720 --> 06:38.279
would make Prince Qian's
posthumous son the heir to the throne.

06:38.680 --> 06:39.720
And I

06:41.120 --> 06:43.439
would never ascend the throne.

06:45.079 --> 06:47.279
My brother and I were of one heart.

06:47.584 --> 06:49.360
We fought side by side
on the battlefield.

06:49.600 --> 06:51.720
We entrusted our lives to one another.

06:52.000 --> 06:55.000
But the throne of Daxing

06:56.920 --> 06:58.560
was within my reach.

07:00.120 --> 07:01.879
It was there for the taking.

07:02.680 --> 07:03.279
I...

07:04.560 --> 07:05.680
So, Your Majesty,

07:06.600 --> 07:07.759
after ascending the throne,

07:08.279 --> 07:09.680
you were burdened with guilt.

07:10.319 --> 07:12.519
You named the Crown Prince
while he was still an infant

07:13.720 --> 07:15.079
and lavished him with every favor.

07:15.839 --> 07:16.879
Precisely because of that,

07:17.712 --> 07:19.750
the Grand Empress Dowager
poured all her hatred

07:20.439 --> 07:22.000
onto the Crown Prince.

07:22.160 --> 07:23.040
Yes.

07:25.079 --> 07:26.759
I carried that guilt.

07:27.480 --> 07:28.399
So...

07:29.800 --> 07:30.839
I...

07:30.864 --> 07:32.944
I did everything
I could to make it up to him.

07:33.560 --> 07:35.639
I treated Huayong as my own son.

07:36.480 --> 07:37.879
The love I gave him

07:38.000 --> 07:41.000
surpassed that for all my own children.

07:41.000 --> 07:43.720
But I never imagined

07:45.319 --> 07:46.839
that my favoritism toward him

07:47.399 --> 07:51.040
would bring about his death.

07:55.040 --> 07:56.480
Mother.

07:59.199 --> 07:59.959
Huayong.

08:01.839 --> 08:03.199
My grandson.

08:06.040 --> 08:08.399
He was my own grandson.

08:11.399 --> 08:11.879
I...

08:13.120 --> 08:15.800
I killed my own grandson.

08:16.160 --> 08:18.199
I was the one who caused your death.

08:21.560 --> 08:22.600
Huayong.

08:23.600 --> 08:25.480
I caused your death.

08:26.000 --> 08:28.079
I wronged you...

08:28.519 --> 08:29.279
Huayong.

08:29.680 --> 08:30.519
Huayong.

08:30.879 --> 08:32.240
My Huayong.

08:34.720 --> 08:36.120
Xihe...

08:37.360 --> 08:39.039
Leave us.

08:53.140 --> 08:53.780
(Book of Wei)

09:00.360 --> 09:01.000
Brother.

09:01.879 --> 09:03.039
How far have you gotten

09:03.320 --> 09:04.440
in the Book of Wei?

09:04.672 --> 09:06.160
Have you gained any insights?

09:07.679 --> 09:08.440
Brother,

09:09.320 --> 09:10.399
I have read

09:10.432 --> 09:12.210
"The people
are the foundation of a nation,

09:12.220 --> 09:13.840
and food is the foundation
of the people.

09:13.904 --> 09:16.030
When those under Heaven
are free from hunger and cold,

09:16.048 --> 09:18.320
the people will have no desire
to abandon their homeland."

09:18.480 --> 09:19.399
I believe

09:19.759 --> 09:21.639
this is how a ruler should govern.

09:23.960 --> 09:24.879
Well said.

09:25.799 --> 09:27.000
As a prince,

09:27.000 --> 09:29.600
you should indeed learn the principles
of governing the realm

09:29.600 --> 09:31.872
from the classics, histories,
philosophy, and literature.

09:32.399 --> 09:34.639
But in the end,
all those teachings come down

09:37.200 --> 09:38.840
to one thing. The hearts of the people.

09:42.440 --> 09:45.000
Only by caring for the people
and understanding their hardships

09:46.200 --> 09:47.799
can a nation stand strong.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.399
I will remember your teachings.

09:51.960 --> 09:52.679
Come with me.

09:56.288 --> 09:58.840
This is a newly crafted Dushan jade
inkstone and a wolf-hair brush

09:58.840 --> 09:59.990
made by the Imperial Workshop.

10:00.440 --> 10:01.960
I had a set prepared for you as well.

10:06.144 --> 10:07.910
Brother, you are
the eldest legitimate son.

10:08.480 --> 10:10.720
Fine food, splendid robes,
books, and classics

10:10.960 --> 10:12.320
have always been yours by right.

10:13.240 --> 10:14.039
Yet you

10:14.279 --> 10:15.960
have always shared them with me.

10:16.200 --> 10:17.639
Even our monthly stipends

10:17.640 --> 10:19.072
have always been exactly the same.

10:19.399 --> 10:20.080
I have

10:21.080 --> 10:22.679
truly overstepped my place.

10:23.000 --> 10:23.679
Juechong.

10:25.519 --> 10:26.799
You are my brother.

10:27.799 --> 10:28.759
Between brothers,

10:29.376 --> 10:30.480
there is no yours or mine.

10:47.940 --> 10:55.020
(Months Later)

10:55.240 --> 10:59.360
(I have received Heaven's Mandate
and inherited the throne,)

11:00.000 --> 11:03.720
(to restore order to the troubled realm
and bring peace under Heaven.)

11:04.639 --> 11:08.679
(Now that my years
are drawing to an end,)

11:09.440 --> 11:13.440
(I hereby issue this edict
to appoint the new Emperor.)

11:14.440 --> 11:16.519
(Imperial Grandson Xiao Junshu,)

11:16.960 --> 11:21.039
(long blessed with auspicious omens
and marked for greatness,)

11:21.840 --> 11:26.159
(I hereby pass the throne
to Imperial Grandson Junshu.)

11:27.240 --> 11:29.360
(Crown Princess Shen Xihe,)

11:29.799 --> 11:33.759
(foremost among the Six Palaces
and mother of the realm,)

11:34.879 --> 11:37.799
(the new Emperor shall honor her
with the utmost filial piety.)

11:38.480 --> 11:41.088
(In keeping with tradition,
the new Emperor)

11:41.088 --> 11:43.600
(shall honor his mother
as Grand Empress Dowager.)

11:45.120 --> 11:46.720
(My choice)

11:47.159 --> 11:48.879
(is worthy
before Heaven and the spirits.)

11:49.840 --> 11:51.440
(All princes and officials,)

11:51.919 --> 11:54.360
(all regional governors
and local magistrates,)

11:54.720 --> 11:56.360
(and all scholars and commoners,)

11:56.639 --> 11:58.200
(shall faithfully obey this decree)

11:58.639 --> 12:00.519
(to fulfill my will.)

12:01.600 --> 12:06.480
(Let this be proclaimed throughout
the realm so all may know.)

12:27.440 --> 12:32.039
- Long live Your Majesty!
- Long live Your Majesty!

12:32.679 --> 12:37.440
- Long live the Grand Empress Dowager!
- Long live the Grand Empress Dowager!

12:41.279 --> 12:44.799
Now that the realm is at peace
and harmony has been restored,

12:45.000 --> 12:46.879
it is fitting to proclaim
a new reign era.

12:47.039 --> 12:52.000
Drawing upon the ideals
of harmony throughout the realm,

12:52.440 --> 12:55.600
the reign title shall be Yonghe.

12:55.648 --> 12:56.960
(Spirit Tablet of Prince Xin,
Xiao Changqing)

12:56.960 --> 12:58.400
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Lady Gu)

13:30.940 --> 13:40.200
(Favorable Weather
and Abundant Harvests)

13:40.200 --> 13:41.488
Greetings, Grand Empress Dowager.

13:42.679 --> 13:43.279
Rise.

13:46.919 --> 13:47.960
Leave us.

14:00.080 --> 14:00.960
My brother

14:02.320 --> 14:04.720
was branded a traitor
who sought to seize the throne.

14:05.480 --> 14:06.679
Under the laws of Daxing,

14:07.799 --> 14:10.519
his name should have been struck
from the Xiao family register

14:10.608 --> 14:12.864
and he would never be interred
in the Imperial Mausoleum.

14:13.024 --> 14:15.180
Fortunately, when the new Emperor
ascended the throne,

14:15.320 --> 14:16.440
he granted a general amnesty.

14:17.344 --> 14:19.280
Thanks to
the Grand Empress Dowager's mercy,

14:19.376 --> 14:21.460
he was allowed to keep
his place in the Xiao family,

14:21.720 --> 14:22.992
his name preserved for posterity.

14:24.320 --> 14:25.320
He was spared the fate

14:25.320 --> 14:27.540
of becoming a wandering soul
with neither roots nor kin.

14:27.550 --> 14:28.992
Your Majesty's great kindness

14:30.399 --> 14:31.759
is beyond my power to repay.

14:32.799 --> 14:33.960
The truth is, your brother

14:35.039 --> 14:37.120
never truly intended
to seize the throne.

14:37.840 --> 14:38.960
The day he wounded you,

14:40.600 --> 14:41.600
he did it on purpose.

14:41.840 --> 14:43.320
He wanted to sever your ties with him

14:43.919 --> 14:45.159
so you would not be implicated.

14:54.360 --> 14:55.080
I know.

14:57.200 --> 14:58.399
No matter what he did,

15:00.200 --> 15:01.559
he would never truly hurt me.

15:06.320 --> 15:07.799
He always put me first,

15:09.720 --> 15:11.440
shielding me from every storm.

15:14.688 --> 15:16.550
He was the best brother
I could ever have.

15:32.440 --> 15:33.120
Your Majesty,

15:34.360 --> 15:35.279
I wish to ask

15:35.639 --> 15:36.759
for an edict from you.

15:37.519 --> 15:38.399
What is it

15:38.639 --> 15:39.440
that you seek?

15:40.799 --> 15:41.879
Please grant me permission

15:42.399 --> 15:43.679
to go to the frontier

15:44.032 --> 15:45.420
and lead the troops in its defense.

15:48.192 --> 15:49.360
Have you thought this through?

15:56.080 --> 15:57.360
If this vast realm

15:58.919 --> 16:00.559
can enjoy lasting prosperity

16:01.679 --> 16:03.039
under Your Majesty's reign,

16:06.360 --> 16:08.759
it would surely be
what my brother always wished to see.

16:13.120 --> 16:14.120
I want to protect it

16:15.519 --> 16:16.519
in his place.

16:17.799 --> 16:18.360
Very well.

16:20.279 --> 16:21.720
I grant your request.

16:24.159 --> 16:25.440
Thank you, Your Majesty.

16:25.840 --> 16:26.639
Rise.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.240
There is one more thing.

16:37.720 --> 16:38.600
My mother...

16:38.840 --> 16:40.240
I will spare her life.

16:40.759 --> 16:41.519
You have my word.

16:45.088 --> 16:46.200
Thank you, Your Majesty.

16:59.879 --> 17:01.399
By decree of the Grand Empress Dowager:

17:01.728 --> 17:04.640
Bu Shuyao, younger sister of the
Young Master to the Marquis of Shunan.

17:04.640 --> 17:06.432
was separated from her family
for many years

17:06.480 --> 17:08.880
before finally being found
and reunited with them.

17:08.890 --> 17:10.400
It is hereby recognized that Bu Shuyao

17:10.400 --> 17:13.119
is of gentle character
and gracious bearing,

17:13.119 --> 17:15.680
blessed with virtue and dignity.

17:15.700 --> 17:17.500
The Grand Empress Dowager
is greatly pleased.

17:17.510 --> 17:19.616
Now that the period
of national mourning has ended,

17:19.620 --> 17:22.784
she is hereby betrothed to Cui Jinbai,
Minister of Court of Judicial Review.

17:22.800 --> 17:25.559
The wedding shall be held
on an auspicious date. So decreed.

17:25.680 --> 17:27.119
I accept the decree.

17:27.799 --> 17:31.319
- Long live the Grand Empress Dowager!
- Long live the Grand Empress Dowager!

17:40.464 --> 17:42.350
The Grand Empress Dowager
has another decree.

17:42.480 --> 17:44.240
She summons you to the palace today.

17:45.000 --> 17:46.240
Very well. I'll go shortly.

17:46.240 --> 17:47.360
Thank you, Chief Steward.

17:53.210 --> 17:54.976
"Of gentle character
and gracious bearing,

17:54.976 --> 17:56.350
blessed with virtue and dignity?"

17:56.839 --> 17:58.119
Is that really me?

17:59.000 --> 18:00.880
Xihe has always loved teasing people.

18:00.880 --> 18:02.160
She must have said it ironically.

18:02.960 --> 18:04.599
You really should break that habit.

18:04.816 --> 18:06.110
When you enter the palace later,

18:06.140 --> 18:08.512
you must not address Grand Empress
Dowager by her given name.

18:13.000 --> 18:14.920
At last, we can finally
be together openly.

18:15.760 --> 18:17.240
Everything in this world may change,

18:18.440 --> 18:19.519
but the love between us

18:20.240 --> 18:21.079
never will.

18:21.160 --> 18:22.200
How sappy.

18:57.079 --> 18:59.279
Greetings, Your Majesty.

19:17.960 --> 19:18.839
Rise.

19:19.880 --> 19:20.960
There's no one else here.

19:20.976 --> 19:22.112
Why are you acting so proper?

19:24.920 --> 19:25.359
Come.

19:34.288 --> 19:36.240
I've been keeping
my back perfectly straight

19:36.720 --> 19:38.759
the whole way just to
look like a proper lady.

19:38.759 --> 19:39.880
My back is killing me.

19:40.279 --> 19:41.240
Why pretend at all?

19:41.700 --> 19:44.200
The Grand Empress Dowager praised me
to the skies in the decree.

19:44.200 --> 19:45.279
I had to live up to it.

19:46.640 --> 19:48.400
I should have arranged
your marriage long ago.

19:48.460 --> 19:50.500
It was delayed because
of the period of national mourning.

19:50.519 --> 19:52.640
I never intended
to marry so soon anyway.

19:52.720 --> 19:53.400
Why not?

19:55.240 --> 19:56.240
Well...

19:57.079 --> 19:58.160
I hadn't had enough fun yet.

19:59.519 --> 20:00.920
Such a pity. Your martial skills

20:00.920 --> 20:01.880
deserve better.

20:05.359 --> 20:06.559
You may choose

20:06.592 --> 20:08.176
between Chief Clerk and Staff Officer.

20:09.000 --> 20:09.759
What?

20:09.839 --> 20:11.240
If Cui Jinbai refuses,

20:11.440 --> 20:12.640
I'll go reason with him myself.

20:13.200 --> 20:15.559
Just follow your heart
and make the choice

20:15.559 --> 20:16.279
you truly want.

20:18.640 --> 20:19.480
Do you mean it?

20:21.279 --> 20:23.960
You trained in martial arts
alongside the soldiers since childhood.

20:23.960 --> 20:26.000
You've endured
far more hardships than most.

20:26.559 --> 20:28.279
I know you love Cui Jinbai,

20:28.640 --> 20:30.000
but I also know you're worried

20:30.200 --> 20:31.559
that once you're married,

20:31.560 --> 20:33.232
you'll be confined
to the inner quarters.

20:37.440 --> 20:38.039
I wish

20:38.816 --> 20:40.310
to serve as a Staff Officer.

20:40.464 --> 20:41.824
Have you made up your mind?

20:42.400 --> 20:43.279
I have.

20:43.640 --> 20:44.119
Very well.

21:14.112 --> 21:15.720
(Four years later)
Everyone, hurry up.

21:15.840 --> 21:17.056
(Four years later)
Yes.

21:17.312 --> 21:19.088
There are still some leaves over there.

21:19.279 --> 21:20.000
- Yes.
- Yes.

21:20.620 --> 21:24.620
(Clear and Serene)

21:24.640 --> 21:26.039
Make sure it's spotless.

21:26.240 --> 21:26.759
Yes.

21:36.640 --> 21:37.400
Mo Yu.

21:37.559 --> 21:38.759
It's blooming again.

21:50.359 --> 21:51.200
Junshu.

21:52.400 --> 21:54.759
This is Chief Justice, Cui Jinbai.

21:55.480 --> 21:57.599
This is Chief Envoy,

21:57.880 --> 21:58.759
Zhao Zhenghao.

22:00.400 --> 22:01.279
From now on,

22:01.480 --> 22:02.880
they will be your Masters.

22:05.600 --> 22:07.780
- Greetings, Your Majesty.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

22:07.799 --> 22:09.039
Rise.

22:11.079 --> 22:12.519
Why don't you greet your Masters?

22:17.160 --> 22:18.200
Greetings,

22:18.759 --> 22:20.839
Masters.

22:22.832 --> 22:24.690
Now that yesterday's
birthday banquet is over,

22:24.960 --> 22:26.160
you have turned four.

22:26.359 --> 22:28.079
It is time to begin
your formal education.

22:28.279 --> 22:30.839
You will study the Thousand
Character Classic and other primers,

22:30.920 --> 22:32.400
along with court etiquette.

22:32.400 --> 22:34.000
Yes, Mother.

22:34.720 --> 22:36.720
These two Masters are highly learned,

22:36.768 --> 22:38.360
each responsible for different subjects.

22:38.380 --> 22:40.279
Besides the classics,
histories, and statecraft,

22:40.352 --> 22:41.550
calligraphy, painting, chess,

22:42.319 --> 22:44.440
martial arts, and foreign languages,

22:44.496 --> 22:46.736
they will also teach you
the art of governing the realm.

22:46.759 --> 22:47.519
Yes.

22:49.240 --> 22:50.319
From now on,

22:50.440 --> 22:52.710
you are to attend lectures
at the Shangshu Hall every day.

22:52.720 --> 22:53.839
You are to arrive at dawn
and leave at dusk.

22:54.000 --> 22:55.744
You will have
one day off every ten days.

22:55.830 --> 22:58.672
There will be monthly examinations
in the fifth and ninth months.

22:58.848 --> 23:01.360
At the end of the year,
you will take the annual examination.

23:01.440 --> 23:03.880
If you wish to advance
to the next level,

23:04.079 --> 23:06.160
you must pass the promotion examination.

23:06.400 --> 23:08.440
I understand.

23:10.359 --> 23:12.240
I'll be relying on you both from now on.

23:14.359 --> 23:16.160
- We are honored by the Grand Empress Dowager's trust.
- We are honored by the Grand Empress Dowager's trust.

23:16.599 --> 23:19.000
- We'll devote ourselves and
- We'll devote ourselves and

23:19.160 --> 23:20.519
- impart our knowledge to His Majesty.
- impart our knowledge to His Majesty.

23:27.820 --> 23:32.680
(Sixian Hall)

23:32.680 --> 23:34.839
Wait here for now.

23:34.839 --> 23:36.559
After I pay my respects to Mother,

23:36.559 --> 23:37.759
I'll return to the study hall.

23:38.279 --> 23:39.000
Yes.

23:53.480 --> 23:55.319
Greetings, Mother.

23:57.480 --> 23:58.160
Come here.

24:00.240 --> 24:00.680
Come.

24:03.519 --> 24:04.400
School is over?

24:05.440 --> 24:07.880
I still have to return
to the study hall to review.

24:07.880 --> 24:10.440
Grand Tutor will set
an examination tomorrow.

24:11.160 --> 24:11.920
What a good boy.

24:14.319 --> 24:15.599
I prepared

24:15.599 --> 24:17.480
your favorite osmanthus rice cakes.

24:26.640 --> 24:27.440
Mother,

24:27.599 --> 24:29.720
what kind of man was Father?

24:29.824 --> 24:31.310
Why do you ask that all of a sudden?

24:31.599 --> 24:35.160
You're always lost in thought
before Father's portrait.

24:35.319 --> 24:37.680
Whenever Baisui sings
"Youyou and Luming",

24:37.680 --> 24:38.960
you always smile

24:38.960 --> 24:41.319
so gently and beautifully.

24:41.400 --> 24:43.160
I am truly curious.

24:43.240 --> 24:46.039
What kind of man was Father?

24:49.400 --> 24:50.759
Your father,

24:51.039 --> 24:52.519
in my heart,

24:53.440 --> 24:54.359
was a perfect man.

24:54.559 --> 24:57.000
No gold is pure, and no man is perfect.

24:57.200 --> 24:59.960
Yet Father was perfect in your eyes.

25:00.640 --> 25:02.960
I really wish I could meet Father.

25:17.460 --> 25:20.540
(Clarity and Serenity)

25:25.920 --> 25:26.640
Mother,

25:26.640 --> 25:28.400
my name is on it.

25:28.640 --> 25:30.680
Did Father leave this for me?

25:30.680 --> 25:32.119
What does it mean?

25:39.160 --> 25:40.160
(To my son, Junshu,)

25:40.560 --> 25:42.070
(if you are reading this letter,)

25:42.192 --> 25:44.208
(then you have already
begun your studies.)

25:44.480 --> 25:46.240
(Reading cultivates wisdom and virtue,)

25:46.288 --> 25:48.080
(and is the foundation
of one's character.)

25:48.090 --> 25:49.990
(Now that you have entered
the world of learning,)

25:50.000 --> 25:52.470
(you must uphold filial piety,
brotherly respect, propriety, and righteousness,)

25:52.480 --> 25:54.656
(and as a ruler,
temper benevolence with authority.)

25:55.119 --> 25:56.160
(The finer principles)

25:56.599 --> 25:58.920
(your mother and the Grand Tutor
will surely teach you.)

25:59.984 --> 26:02.110
(Though I cannot remain
by your side as your father,)

26:02.440 --> 26:04.160
(I know you will become a wise ruler.)

26:04.384 --> 26:06.200
(All that I have learned
and contemplated)

26:06.240 --> 26:07.680
(I leave to these written pages.)

26:09.200 --> 26:11.400
(May you surpass your father,)

26:11.584 --> 26:13.680
(and never fail the hopes
your parents place in you.)

26:14.560 --> 26:16.480
(Above all, honor and care
for your mother.)

26:19.400 --> 26:20.240
(Remember this well.)

26:20.240 --> 26:22.700
(Your father, Huayong.)

26:23.839 --> 26:26.000
Mother, what did Father say?

26:31.400 --> 26:32.599
Your father said

26:33.400 --> 26:34.799
he is proud of you.

26:35.359 --> 26:36.400
He also said

26:36.480 --> 26:37.640
Little Goldfish

26:37.759 --> 26:40.039
will become a truly great Emperor.

26:40.200 --> 26:42.039
As great as Father?

26:42.160 --> 26:43.759
Then in your heart,

26:43.759 --> 26:45.640
am I a perfect man, too?

26:46.240 --> 26:47.359
Compared with your father,

26:47.472 --> 26:48.790
you're still just a little short.

26:49.680 --> 26:50.640
You must keep trying.

26:51.400 --> 26:53.720
I will become just as great as Father.

26:53.720 --> 26:56.160
No, I'll become
even greater than Father.

26:58.039 --> 26:58.519
Come.

26:58.960 --> 27:00.119
Let's read it together.

27:02.192 --> 27:05.310
- Heaven was dark and Earth was yellow.
- Heaven was dark and Earth was yellow.

27:05.320 --> 27:07.936
- The cosmos was vast and primordial.
- The cosmos was vast and primordial.

27:08.000 --> 27:10.944
- The sun and moon wax and wane.
- The sun and moon wax and wane.

27:10.950 --> 27:14.290
- The stars are arrayed across the heavens.
- The stars are arrayed across the heavens.

27:22.160 --> 27:23.279
What happened?

27:29.119 --> 27:30.319
How did he

27:30.400 --> 27:32.224
suddenly collapse
at the training grounds?

27:41.440 --> 27:42.480
Summon Zhao Zhenghao.

27:43.079 --> 27:44.039
I'll ask him

27:44.119 --> 27:45.400
what exactly happened.

27:45.960 --> 27:47.279
No need to summon Zhao Zhenghao.

27:48.000 --> 27:50.910
It's only natural to feel exhausted
after training at the martial grounds.

27:50.928 --> 27:52.432
We should summon the Imperial Physician

27:52.559 --> 27:54.440
to see if there's
anything else to worry about.

28:01.599 --> 28:03.960
Mother, I'm all right.

28:03.960 --> 28:05.920
I'll be fine after a few days' rest.

28:06.599 --> 28:07.799
Little Goldfish,

28:07.840 --> 28:10.096
you shouldn't refuse
to see the Imperial Physician.

28:10.119 --> 28:12.119
We should have
the Imperial Physician examine you.

28:13.799 --> 28:14.799
Youyou, do you know

28:15.559 --> 28:16.720
there is a remedy

28:16.832 --> 28:18.528
that can cure Little Goldfish's illness?

28:19.000 --> 28:19.920
What kind of medicine?

28:21.480 --> 28:22.960
It's quite difficult to obtain.

28:23.240 --> 28:24.400
It requires Youyou's approval.

28:25.119 --> 28:27.319
Just let the boy rest for three days

28:27.720 --> 28:29.400
and spare him Cui Jinbai's questioning.

28:31.279 --> 28:32.720
Father is the worst.

28:33.480 --> 28:35.680
Grand Tutor Cui is so strict.

28:35.824 --> 28:37.310
If you don't understand your lessons,

28:37.519 --> 28:38.960
just ask your father.

28:39.559 --> 28:41.000
How can a true gentleman

28:41.160 --> 28:43.440
deceive his mother like this?

28:47.119 --> 28:49.000
Pretending to be sick
to avoid his studies.

28:49.119 --> 28:50.720
He's exactly like you.

28:57.200 --> 28:58.720
But what Father teaches

28:58.720 --> 29:01.039
is different from
what Grand Tutor Cui teaches.

29:07.079 --> 29:08.240
What your father teaches you

29:08.559 --> 29:09.720
is the way of a ruler.

29:10.680 --> 29:11.920
What Grand Tutor Cui teaches you

29:11.920 --> 29:13.559
is the way of a minister.

29:14.960 --> 29:18.000
Then why do I have to learn
two different explanations?

29:18.759 --> 29:20.759
What your father teaches you

29:20.920 --> 29:23.000
is how to rule as an Emperor.

29:23.408 --> 29:24.920
What Grand Tutor Cui teaches you

29:24.920 --> 29:26.480
is how to serve as a minister,

29:26.880 --> 29:28.519
so that you will understand

29:28.519 --> 29:30.000
how to govern your officials.

29:30.576 --> 29:31.720
Do you understand now?

29:34.039 --> 29:35.559
If you earn the highest evaluation,

29:36.039 --> 29:37.160
your mother and I

29:37.248 --> 29:38.790
will take you outside the palace.

29:38.799 --> 29:39.880
That's wonderful!

29:39.880 --> 29:41.599
Father is the best!

29:41.599 --> 29:43.440
Mother is the best, too!

29:43.519 --> 29:46.119
We finally get to go out together!

29:57.039 --> 29:57.759
Your Majesty.

29:59.839 --> 30:00.480
Your Majesty.

30:01.799 --> 30:02.519
Your Majesty.

30:06.592 --> 30:08.340
It's already a quarter
into the Mao hour.

30:08.359 --> 30:09.519
If you don't get up now,

30:09.519 --> 30:11.240
you'll be late for morning court.

30:15.799 --> 30:17.960
It's been a long time
since you've slept so soundly.

30:18.319 --> 30:19.079
Your Majesty,

30:19.400 --> 30:20.759
you were smiling in your sleep.

30:20.960 --> 30:22.559
Were you having a pleasant dream?

30:25.160 --> 30:25.920
Yes.

30:28.720 --> 30:29.880
A rare and wonderful dream.

30:35.680 --> 30:38.240
The people are of greatest importance.
The state comes next.

30:38.240 --> 30:39.560
The ruler is the least important.

30:39.680 --> 30:42.880
Therefore, one who wins the hearts
of the people becomes the Son of Heaven.

30:42.944 --> 30:45.160
One who wins the favor of the Son
of Heaven becomes a feudal lord.

30:45.160 --> 30:47.240
One who wins the favor
of the feudal lords becomes a minister.

30:51.400 --> 30:52.160
Xihe,

30:53.400 --> 30:54.519
do you still remember

30:55.232 --> 30:57.536
the day the maple leaves
were at their reddest?

30:58.480 --> 30:59.640
After our afternoon nap,

31:00.519 --> 31:02.319
we quietly

31:03.040 --> 31:04.590
drank chilled plum juice together.

31:06.000 --> 31:07.000
The breeze

31:07.904 --> 31:09.400
drifted through the little window.

31:10.759 --> 31:12.359
That simple, ordinary life

31:13.400 --> 31:14.960
was life's finest moment.

31:23.279 --> 31:24.400
The autumn air is dry.

31:25.440 --> 31:26.440
Have a cup of plum juice

31:27.119 --> 31:28.000
to soothe your throat.

31:36.880 --> 31:38.400
Thank you, Mother.

31:41.640 --> 31:42.400
Mother,

31:42.400 --> 31:45.440
I received the highest evaluation
at my last assessment.

31:45.640 --> 31:47.440
Grand Tutor Cui and General Bu

31:47.519 --> 31:49.319
took me outside the palace.

31:49.319 --> 31:51.880
I saw this
exquisitely embroidered sachet.

31:51.880 --> 31:54.000
Knowing how much you love ginkgo leaves,

31:54.359 --> 31:56.519
I bought it for you.

32:03.240 --> 32:04.359
I like it.

32:05.839 --> 32:06.880
Thank you, Little Goldfish.

32:17.200 --> 32:17.720
My Lord,

32:17.776 --> 32:19.904
Official Zhao brought a package
from outside the palace.

32:19.984 --> 32:21.792
He insisted it be handed
to you in person.

33:38.480 --> 33:39.640
Tagara Incense?

34:32.260 --> 34:37.700
♪Let it all go,
give my tears to the flowers♪

34:38.900 --> 34:44.980
♪Beneath my feet, eternal doom
is more than wind and sand♪

34:46.100 --> 34:51.940
♪That perfectly plotted love
hides in the clamor♪

34:53.340 --> 34:59.180
♪Between us, it's both
treacherous and flawless♪

35:00.340 --> 35:05.660
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

35:05.660 --> 35:13.780
♪As night stains my eyes,
I'll gaze once more at the rosy clouds♪

35:13.780 --> 35:17.620
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

35:17.620 --> 35:21.180
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

35:21.180 --> 35:24.540
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

35:24.540 --> 35:28.060
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

35:41.360 --> 35:42.239
I'm back.

35:45.920 --> 35:47.480
I feared this beautiful moment

35:50.320 --> 35:51.800
would find you with no companion.

35:54.000 --> 35:55.440
So I come back.

35:59.220 --> 36:01.920
♪Across countless miles
of treasured moments♪

36:01.920 --> 36:04.900
♪Every move is a game of truth and lies♪

36:05.039 --> 36:06.360
I've kept you waiting so long.

36:10.960 --> 36:11.679
I'm sorry.

36:13.500 --> 36:18.940
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

36:19.380 --> 36:26.940
♪As night stains my eyes,
I'll gaze once more at the rosy clouds♪

36:26.940 --> 36:30.780
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

36:33.079 --> 36:34.599
Marrying you in this life,

36:35.719 --> 36:37.360
I will never regret it.

36:37.980 --> 36:41.420
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

36:44.580 --> 36:48.260
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

36:48.260 --> 36:51.780
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

36:51.780 --> 36:55.220
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

36:55.220 --> 36:58.780
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

36:58.780 --> 37:02.100
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

37:02.100 --> 37:05.700
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

37:05.700 --> 37:08.940
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

37:08.940 --> 37:12.220
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

37:17.940 --> 37:20.060
♪May the sand and dirt in my sleeves♪

37:20.060 --> 37:22.860
♪Become the tears
in the corner of my eyes♪

37:24.060 --> 37:26.020
♪And blossom into a flower♪

37:51.740 --> 37:54.460
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

37:55.500 --> 37:57.980
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

37:59.100 --> 38:04.100
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

38:06.260 --> 38:08.860
♪I've hidden so many words♪

38:08.860 --> 38:12.380
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

38:13.500 --> 38:20.500
♪So never uncover♪

38:20.500 --> 38:23.300
♪Wind that misses the grasp♪

38:24.380 --> 38:26.660
♪Light that ignites at a single touch♪

38:27.460 --> 38:32.820
♪A person can find
strength time and again♪

38:34.820 --> 38:37.700
♪Our past♪

38:38.660 --> 38:40.980
♪Has been full of ups
and downs along the way♪

38:41.820 --> 38:45.660
♪Admitting my confusion
just like your regret♪

38:45.660 --> 38:49.020
♪How hard can it be?♪

38:51.860 --> 38:55.420
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

38:55.820 --> 38:59.300
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

38:59.660 --> 39:05.700
♪So brave as if
not afraid of disappointment♪

39:06.780 --> 39:09.700
♪You understand my pride♪

39:10.540 --> 39:13.620
♪It is actually just like yours♪

39:13.620 --> 39:20.100
♪So please try your best
to be open first♪

39:20.100 --> 39:24.300
♪The flustered mortal world♪

39:24.820 --> 39:27.940
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

39:27.940 --> 39:31.620
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

39:31.620 --> 39:38.100
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

39:38.980 --> 39:45.180
♪The flustered mortal world♪

39:46.380 --> 39:49.700
♪Your eyes remain clear and bright♪

39:49.700 --> 39:53.100
(No animals were harmed
during the filming of this production)
